- Atomic workflow hardening across auth, onboarding, admissions, sessions,
  homework, HR, users, NepalPay, and connectIPS.
- Migration `20260729090000_atomic_workflow_constraints`.
- Expanded Tenant Admin integration concurrency/duplicate coverage.
