  work, including migration `20260729150000_tenant_admin_petty_cash_decisions`.
- Tenant Admin API/error foundation, admissions, settings/control center, petty
  cash, payroll, reports, HR alerts, resources, calendar, navigation cleanup,
  API-gap documentation, and authenticated smoke coverage.
- Docker-safe Prisma seed runner and corrected local provisioning workflow.
- Student web portal, navigation, StyleSeed alignment, responsive/accessibility
  polish, homework filtering, score trend lines, attendance/fees/identity/
  certificate/calendar/notification views, and verified local demo-student
  authentication.
- Student portal data is now loaded through authenticated
  `GET /api/users/me/student-portal`; the API resolves the student exclusively
  from the active session and returns that student's enrollments, timetable,
  homework/submissions/results, attendance, invoices/Nepal Pay data,
  certificates, calendar events, notifications, profile, and derived insights.
  `StudentPortal.tsx` no longer imports shared fixture records for its normal
  render path. Loading, failure/retry, and true empty states replace fake
  fallback records. Dashboard date, attendance rate, latest score, branch, and
  identity values are also response-driven. Local runtime verification returned
  the authenticated database student Anisha Poudel and empty collections where
  that student currently has no institutional records, rather than Aarav/shared
  dummy records.
- The student fixture exports have now been removed entirely from
  `studentPortalData.ts`; that file contains contracts and calculations only.
  The portal refreshes its authenticated aggregate only when the student opens
  the portal or navigates to another student section; it does not poll on a
  timer or refresh on focus/network events. The last good response remains
  visible if a section refresh fails. The aggregate now includes institution
  and branch identity, all active course types, real homework/submission detail,
  numeric graded results with real class averages and subject histories,
  attendance, leave outcomes, invoice totals/statuses, calendar records,
  certificates, and record-derived notifications.
- Student Nepal Pay payment dialogs now fetch the authorized per-invoice EMV
  payload from `/api/finances/nepalpay-qr/:invoiceId` and render a real QR image;
  placeholder QR artwork is gone. Certificate downloads use authenticated
  `/api/certificates/:certificateId/download` and generate a PDF from the
  persisted certificate/student/branch/template record, rather than exposing
  the placeholder storage URL.
- `/api/leaves/request` now supports a parent-supplied `studentId` only after
  validating the authenticated parent-child link and the child's active/blocked
  enrollment in the requested branch. The leave is stored against the child's
  user record, allowing the existing approval and attendance flows to produce
  Absent (Excused) and the student portal's live leave confirmation.
- Student dark mode now initializes before first paint, follows OS preference on
  first use, persists the manual dashboard toggle, sets the correct browser
  color scheme, and uses dark semantic tokens for cards, headings, states, and
  student-specific surfaces. Authenticated Chrome QA passes at desktop and
  375px mobile widths for account isolation, live status, empty states, dark
  mode, and digital ID. The test is
  `apps/web/tests/student-live-smoke.js`.
- Parent web portal, linked-child URL scoping, oversight, privacy-filtered
  remarks/teachers, appointment/leave UX, child-specific fees/certificates/
  calendar/notifications, unavailable-contract states, and authenticated parent
  Chrome smoke coverage.
- Teacher web portal, mobile-first geo-attendance UX, scheduled multi-branch
  context, separate personalized sessions, mandatory daily updates, locked
  student-attendance states, homework/results previews, own performance/leave
  records, unmerged stamp history, and credential-gated Teacher smoke coverage.
